 - Fix: reuse the existing manifestation preview/execute path with deterministic pre-build causal families (scale-up, scale-down, seed-shift); select family from step only, record modelFamily, and execute the exact predicted intervention.
 - Regression: deterministic bounded family selection plus existing prediction-before-build/delta tests.
 - Negative outcomes remain recorded; no thresholds changed and no duplicate science/runtime system added.
+
+## Dark Void V5 long-session journal compaction repair
+- Root cause: persistence stores only the last 512 RecipeJournal rows, but verifier required the first persisted row to point to genesis. After >512 actions, reload rejected both localStorage and IndexedDB snapshots; restored append could also regress step numbering because it used rows.length.
+- Fix: verifier supports anchored contiguous journal segments while still validating every retained hash/link/step; append continues from the retained tail step.
+- Regression: >520 actions -> 512-row persisted segment -> exact valid reload -> next step remains 520.
+- No duplicate journal/storage/runtime introduced.
